1
00:00:00,923 --> 00:00:02,483
(Sheldon:)It's him.

2
00:00:05,227 --> 00:00:06,697
(Raj:)Hello?

3
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,060
(Sheldon:)Well, I see.

4
00:00:10,132 --> 00:00:11,622
(Sheldon:)Yes.

5
00:00:12,001 --> 00:00:15,491
(Sheldon:)All right, we can come get you.
Yeah, we'll see you soon.

6
00:00:15,738 --> 00:00:17,468
(Sheldon:)- Bye.
- Where is he?

7
00:00:17,706 --> 00:00:22,106
(Sheldon:)The third floor landing. The poor old guy's
been walking up the stairs for half an hour.

8
00:00:26,348 --> 00:00:27,408
(Sheldon:)It's really you.

9
00:00:32,788 --> 00:00:34,618
(Leonard:)Mr. Jeffries, I am so sorry.

10
00:00:34,824 --> 00:00:37,224
We should have told you
about the broken elevator.

11
00:00:37,426 --> 00:00:39,256
(Arthur:)I agree.

12
00:00:40,596 --> 00:00:44,036
(Sheldon:)Professor Proton,
it's an honor to meet you.

13
00:00:44,266 --> 00:00:46,026
Uh, just call me Arthur.

14
00:00:46,535 --> 00:00:48,095
(Sheldon:)Leonard...

15
00:00:50,139 --> 00:00:51,159
...did you hear that?

16
00:00:51,373 --> 00:00:54,133
(Sheldon:)Professor Proton said
I should call him Arthur.

17
00:00:54,343 --> 00:00:57,023
(Sheldon:)That means we're friends.

